# Commit docs and agent instructions. CLAUDE.md imports AGENTS.md.
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
!docs/**/*.md
# Browser test traces, logs and raw data exports stay local.
docs/**/*.zip
docs/**/*.log
docs/**/*.csv
docs/Total Punches.md
# Payslip PDFs and browser-test result logs from reviews stay local.
docs/superpowers/reviews/**/*.pdf
docs/superpowers/reviews/**/*.json
